o padre lo sfida ad iscriversi in una prestigiosa scuola di cucina in cui solo il 10% degli studenti riesce ad ottenere il diploma. Ce la farà ?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Food Wars! Shokugeki no Soma","overview":"Young chef Soma enters the prestigious Totsuki Culinary Academy, where he must emerge victorious in over-the-top cooking battles or face expulsion."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"下町の定食屋の息子・幸平創真は、家業を手伝いながら、父・幸平城一郎を越えるべく料理修業に励む日々を過ごしていた。ところが、中学校卒業後は家業を継ごうと考えていた創真をよそに、城一郎は店を数年閉めると宣言して海外に渡る。城一郎の命により、超名門料理学校「遠月茶寮料理學園」の高等部に入学した創真は、持ち前の料理のノウハウを駆使して料理人として成長していく。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rO11TGG5ZG1LlmSJX0Q1j1AWGZJ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rO11TGG5ZG1LlmSJX0Q1j1AWGZJ.png","language":"en","width":761,"height":538},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Lh4zpeDHJD3ZW6SdARrqJuMqGo.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9Lh4zpeDHJD3ZW6SdARrqJuMqGo.png","language":"en","width":1278,"height":367},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/juu9f3JMtqkNLcpYhjuyyRNNQ50.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/juu9f3JMtqkNLcpYhjuyyRNNQ50.png","language":"ja","width":564,"height":538},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3iEYTX7OxsduLJqVwA3iA1a1Zs0.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3iEYTX7OxsduLJqVwA3iA1a1Zs0.png","language":"ja","width":193,"height":198},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ladvSio2Uh94eWGxSOkdIFcDdOg.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ladvSio2Uh94eWGxSOkdIFcDdOg.png","language":"ja","width":193,"height":203},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ahN7bwAH4ymsKe8ecJg3rzg3RPN.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ahN7bwAH4ymsKe8ecJg3rzg3RPN.png","language":"ja","width":193,"height":200}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eAQHqcJXP0FBzXvQkIV5g5ZueZb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://